(Dufs Lume UI - Deployment Guide) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Build the skin) Tj
T*
(   pnpm install && pnpm build) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Serve it with dufs via --assets) Tj
T*
(   dufs /var/lib/dufs --assets ./dist --allow-upload) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Cache behaviour \(measured on dufs 0.47.0\)) Tj
T*
(   Every file under --assets is served with) Tj
T*
(   cache-control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable) Tj
T*
(   index.html alone is no-cache. That is why the bundle) Tj
T*
(   file names carry a content hash, and why a release) Tj
T*
(   replaces the whole assets directory.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Extension endpoints) Tj
T*
(   GET /__lume__/info   session probe + free/data bytes) Tj
T*
(   GET /__lume__/thumb  server-side thumbnails \(128/256/512\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
